# 'unity': record 1 done by a claim, 3009 (unity) taken and done by UnityChat. Taking it again is refused (it is
# complete and not a repeat). Logged out over the next block of the shared clock and back in: the completion is cleared
# and 3009 can be taken again.
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=5
login
record take 1
record progress 1 1
record claim 1
record take 3009
record event UnityChat
record take 3009 refused
logout
wait jst=6
login
record take 3009
